title: Fundraising
new-page: true
view-if: fundraising_timer <= 0 and (not historical_mode)
on-arrival: fundraising_timer = 6
frequency: 300
is-card: true
card-image: img/money.png
tags: party_affairs

= Fundraising

@money

For better or for worse, the party cannot exist without money.

- @dues: Adjust yearly member dues.
- @aristocrat: Seek financial backing from the wealthy aristocrats. WIP

@dues

Party treasury may adjust the yearly dues of grassroots members.

- @maintain: Maintain our current dues.
- @reduce: Reduce dues.
- @increase: Increase dues.

@maintain
subtitle: We gain [+ dues +] resources per year.

We maintain our current dues.

@reduce
subtitle: We will gain [+ dues - 1 +] resources per year. -1 resource
choose-if: dues > 1
on-arrival: dues -= 1; resources -= 1; wilopo_dissent -= 8; partindo_dissent -= 8; sidik_dissent -= 8; month_actions += 1

Our current members appreciate this, but no one decides to join a party because of the low dues.

@increase
subtitle: We will gain [+ dues + 1 +] resources per year. +1 resource [? if unemployed >= 15 : Given the present economic situation, this may be painful. ?][? if dues >= 4 : Dues are already rather high; increasing them might reduce our membership. ?]
on-arrival: dues += 1; resources += 1; rural_pni -= 3; middle_pni -= 3; rural_pni -= 10 if unemployed >= 15; middle_pni -= 10 if unemployed >= 15; rural_pni -= 3*dues if dues >= 5; middle_pni -= 3*dues if dues >= 5; month_actions += 1
view-if: dues <= 4

Our members grumble at this, and some of the less committed members leave. But now, we have access to additional resources. 

[? if unemployed >= 15 : Because of the presently high unemployment, our members are feeling the extra burden hard. ?]

@aristocrat
